This is my new flat in Kochi.
I stand near the door.
I open the door.
I have heavy bags in my hands.
I go inside slowly.
I put the big suitcase near the front door.
Now the suitcase sits there.
A small bag lies on the floor.
Now I am in the living room.
There is good light in this room.
There is some furniture in the room.
A large sofa sits there.
There is a small table near the sofa.
An old book sits on top of the table.
I go near the window.
A nice January breeze comes in.
I stand in the middle of the room.
I look at the new home.
This is my own home.
I am very happy.
